cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or adapt this repository, please cite both the repository and
  the associated manuscript using the metadata below.
title: "URO-FND Clustering Study Repository: 3D UMAP & HDBSCAN"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Monteiro
    given-names: Sara
date-released: 2026-08-16
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/UROFND-repo"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained research notebook for standardizing prespecified clinical
  features, estimating a three-dimensional UMAP embedding, applying HDBSCAN,
  visualizing density-based profiles, and exporting reproducible model outputs.
keywords:
  - functional neurological disorder
  - UMAP
  - HDBSCAN
  - unsupervised learning
  - clustering
  - reproducible research
